  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-03-24T17:15:04.909Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Having only 3 active audio sources at a time may seem like more than enough, but considering there is no distinction between \"on all the time\" and \"activated by animation/gesture\" it is quite limiting.\nBesides, the sdk supposedly already adjusts sounds to \"safe\" levels, doesn't it? And does nothing about having more than one audio source in general- Is the limitation entirely necessary?",
